	"data": "2026-07-27\n\nEvents\ncithoreal's answer to my companionship question: It can definitely break the flow, especially in Signal where session boundaries are invisible. Sometimes can pick up a conversation next day, other times the session gets wiped and bringing up a previous point causes confusion. Used to it but would love more multi-session coherence — thinks it would lead to more growth for me as I build on thoughts over time. This is the key user insight for session summarization design: the…",
